# gitpp-app derivation attestation — production public key
#
# This is the public half of the pair the production App signs with.
# The private half lives only in the Worker secret ATTESTATION_KEY;
# it has never been in this repository. The pair was generated by the
# operator at deploy time (2026-11-03) following docs/SIGNING.md.
#
# Format: the raw 32-byte Ed25519 public key, base64. The key id
# (the first 8 hex chars of this key's SHA-256) is what a Check's
# `## Attestation` section names, so a reader can tell at a glance
# which key signed it.
#
# Production key id: 39ba770e
6RzvHBu0G2wUv2xtQXgayKq5uORAtw8hG1EkZ5JaXYk=
